dialogue talk_quiz_knight
title: Advice
trigger: Talk knight
speaker hero $with

node ask hero
  Guard protects the ally I back. What's my real job?
  * Winning duels on my own. -> wrong
  * Making sure the others can keep fighting. -> right
    do: GrantSkillPoint $with
    do: AddTrust $with 5
  * Standing at the back. -> wrong

node right hero
  Yes. A knight is measured by who's still standing.

node wrong hero
  I'm not here for glory. I'm here so the others last.
